      {
        "time": 0.2,
        "duration": 15.404042,
        "english": "If it crosses the line, the nearest batteries may fire within their assigned lanes. Controlled bursts. Break off if the beam reflects across friendly positions. A shot that misses safely is better than a correction that strikes one of our own.",
        "text": "目标越线后，最近的炮组可在各自射界内开火，控制点射。光束若反射穿过己方位置，立即停火。安全脱靶，也好过修正射击却击中自己人。",
        "role": "commander"
      },
      {
        "time": 15.704041,
